:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/151361/151361.jpg\" alt=\"福井マンテンホテル駅前（マンテンホテルグループ）\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-blue-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-blue-950\">福井マンテンホテル駅前（マンテンホテルグループ）</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-blue-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">ＪＲ福井駅徒歩１分。露天・サウナ付大浴場完備！なつかしの惣菜・北陸の味 選べる和朝食・洋朝食</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F151361%2F151361.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-600 hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-cyan-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      👉 駅近・送迎付き宿のプランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/10 via-cyan-500/10 to-indigo-500/10 border border-blue-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-blue-900 bg-blue-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase\">✨ おすすめ 第4位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-blue-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">福島県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-blue-800\">⭐ 3.99 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/18143/18143.jpg\" alt=\"駅前フジグランドホテル\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-blue-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-blue-950\">駅前フジグランドホテル</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-blue-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">会津若松駅から徒歩1分　駐車場無料</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F18143%2F18143.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block px-6 py-3 bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-600 hover:from-blue-500 hover:to-cyan-500 text-white font-extrabold text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition\">\n      👉 駅近・送迎付き宿のプランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-500/10 via-cyan-500/10 to-indigo-500/10 border border-blue-400/40 shadow-sm space-y-4\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-gray-300/40 pb-3\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-black text-blue-900 bg-blue-200 px-3 py-1 rounded-full uppercase\">✨ おすすめ 第5位</span>\n      <span class=\"text-[10px] font-bold text-blue-900 bg-white border border-gray-300/60 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\">島根県</span>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-blue-800\">⭐ 4 / 5.0</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-4\">\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-1/3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/153414/153414.jpg\" alt=\"浪花旅館\" class=\"w-full h-auto rounded-xl shadow-md border border-blue-200\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"w-full md:w-2/3 space-y-2\">\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-black font-journal-serif text-blue-950\">浪花旅館</h3>\n      <p class=\"text-xs text-blue-950/80 leading-relaxed font-medium\">ＪＲ出雲横田駅前にある元料亭の浪花旅館。島根の山海の幸を添えた創作料理をご提供しております。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"pt-4 text-right\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Ftravel.rakuten.co.jp%2FHOTEL%2F153414%2F1